{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"LatePaymentFees\">Late payment fees</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Invoice Invoices Is Late_Payment_Fees LatePaymentFee LatePaymentFees On Overdue Payment Sales SalesInvoice SalesInvoices\">The <strong>Late Payment Fees</strong> screen displays overdue sales invoices that are eligible for <em>late payment charges</em>.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Automatic Invoice Invoices Is Late_Payment_Fees LatePaymentFee LatePaymentFees On Payment Settings To ToDate\">This screen automatically identifies invoices that meet the criteria for <em>late payment fees</em> based on your configured settings.</p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"\">How it works</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Balance Invoice Late_Payment_Fees LatePaymentFee LatePaymentFees Payment Percentage\"><em>Late payment fees</em> are calculated as a percentage of the outstanding invoice balance.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Invoice On Overdue Percentage Rate Sales SalesInvoice Settings\">The system checks each overdue invoice and calculates fees based on the <em>percentage rate</em> specified in the sales invoice settings.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Date DueDate On Rate\">Fees are generated monthly after the initial <em>due date</em> has passed.</p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Late_Payment_Fees LatePaymentFee LatePaymentFees Payment\">Creating late payment fees</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"By From FromDate Invoice Invoices Is Next On Select To ToDate\">Select one or more invoices from the list by checking the boxes next to them.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Invoice Invoices LatePaymentFee NewLatePaymentFee On Payment Rate Select To ToDate\">Click the <strong>New Late Payment Fee</strong> button to generate the fees for the selected invoices.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Automatic Create Invoice Invoices On Sales SalesInvoice SalesInvoices To ToDate\">The fees will be automatically created and linked to the corresponding sales invoices.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Date\">Date</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Date\">Date</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Date Invoice Is LatePaymentFee Payment\">The date when the <em>late payment fee</em> becomes applicable for this invoice.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Date DueDate Invoice Is On\">This is typically one day after the invoice <em>due date</em> for the first fee, then monthly thereafter.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Customer\">Customer</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Customer\">Customer</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom Customer LatePaymentFee Payment To ToDate\">The customer who will be charged the <em>late payment fee</em>.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom Customer Invoice Is Overdue Sales SalesInvoice To ToDate\">This is the customer associated with the overdue <em>sales invoice</em>.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"SalesInvoice\">Sales Invoice</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"SalesInvoice\">Sales Invoice</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Invoice Is LatePaymentFee Overdue Payment Sales SalesInvoice\">The overdue <em>sales invoice</em> that is triggering the <em>late payment fee</em>.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Edit Invoice InvoiceNumber On To ToDate View\">Click on the invoice number to view or edit the original invoice details.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"BalanceDue\">Balance due</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"BalanceDue\">Balance due</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Balance Is LatePaymentFee On Payment\">The outstanding balance on which the <em>late payment fee</em> is calculated.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount Invoice Is On Paid Port Rate Sent Unpaid\">This amount represents the unpaid portion of the invoice at the time the fee is being generated.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NewLatePaymentFee\">New Late Payment Fee</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NewLatePaymentFee\">New Late Payment Fee</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount Custom Customer LatePaymentFee Payment To ToDate\">The calculated <em>late payment fee</em> amount that will be charged to the customer.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Automatic Invoice Is On Percentage Rate Sales SalesInvoice Settings To ToDate\">This fee is automatically calculated based on the <em>percentage rate</em> configured in the sales invoice settings.</p></div></details>",
  "key": "pending-late-payment-fees"
